        "description": "One Blibli product: SKU, item SKU, name, link, product code, EAN, price, list price and discount (IDR), stock, installment offer, brand (official flag), merchant (name, official flag, location, warehouses, review score, positive-review and on-time rates, badge, review count, join date, logo, store link), rating and review count, categories, specifications, variant options, description, tags, images, and the site's record in `raw`.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/blibli-product",
        "tags": [
          "Blibli"
        ],
        "x-credits": 1,
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Product SKU or product link (https://www.blibli.com/p/.../ps--APF-70017-00969).",
